DECLARE
 j constant jsonb := $records$[{"id":"ec187585-de34-4781-8353-9b8e3da68885","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"pollo-agridulce","public_path":"/pollo-agridulce","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/pollo-agridulce/","language":"es","title":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén con piña y pimientos","excerpt":"Pechuga, piña y pimientos con salsa agridulce medida: cocción por tandas, termómetro y sin fritura profunda.","summary":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén con piña fresca, pimientos y salsa de kétchup, vinagre y soja. Cuatro porciones en 51 minutos propuestos, sin marinado ni fritura profunda, con termómetro y nutrición estimada trazable USDA; rendimiento y prueba de cocina no confirmados.","category":"Platos principales","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Plato principal","cuisine":"Inspiración chino-estadounidense","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"pechuga de pollo cruda sin piel ni huesos, sin solución añadida","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"almidón de maíz para el pollo","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"aceite de canola: para las dos tandas de pollo y las verduras","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sartén"},{"name":"piña fresca pelada sin corazón duro","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Verduras y fruta"},{"name":"pimiento rojo limpio sin semillas ni tallo","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Verduras y fruta"},{"name":"pimiento verde limpio sin semillas ni tallo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Verduras y fruta"},{"name":"cebolla pelada","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Verduras y fruta"},{"name":"kétchup de tomate normal","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"vinagre blanco alimentario de acidez 5 %","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"azúcar blanco granulado","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"salsa de soja con trigo tipo shoyu normal","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"agua potable: para la salsa y la suspensión de almidón","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"almidón de maíz para espesar la salsa","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"}],"steps":[{"title":"Organiza ingredientes y separa crudo de cocinado","content":"Prepara una sartén amplia de fondo grueso, termómetro alimentario, dos tablas, cuchillos, pinzas para pollo crudo, utensilios limpios para cocinado, cuencos y báscula. Pesa 600 g de pechuga cruda sin piel ni hueso y sin solución o salmuera añadida. Mantén el pollo a 4 °C o menos y no lo laves. Si está congelado, descongela de forma segura en frigorífico y añade el tiempo real, no incluido en esta propuesta para pollo ya descongelado. Lava las manos con jabón al menos 20 segundos. Lava fruta y verduras bajo agua potable antes de pelar o cortar, sin jabón ni lejía. Ten listas las cantidades de la lista; los pesos de fruta y verduras son netos, después de eliminar lo no comestible. Es una versión a la sartén, no una fritura profunda de restaurante ni un rebozado grueso.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Organiza ingredientes y separa crudo de cocinado"},{"title":"Corta la piña y las verduras","content":"Con tabla y cuchillo limpios, prepara y pesa 200 g de piña fresca sin piel ni corazón duro, 150 g de pimiento rojo y 100 g de verde sin semillas ni tallos, y 120 g de cebolla pelada. Corta fruta y verduras en trozos de unos 2 cm para que se cocinen con un tamaño similar. Reserva separados de pollo crudo y sus utensilios. No cuentes piel, semillas, corazón duro, recortes ni agua de lavado en la nutrición. La fórmula usa piña fresca, no piña en almíbar ni su jugo; si la cambias, registra otra fórmula y recalcula. No añadas zanahoria, brócoli ni adornos manteniendo estas cifras.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Corta la piña y las verduras"},{"title":"Corta y cubre el pollo con almidón","content":"En otra tabla destinada a crudo, corta los 600 g de pechuga en dados de unos 2 cm. Si hace falta, seca la superficie con papel desechable; no laves el pollo ni reutilices ese papel. Mezcla todos los dados con los 20 g de almidón de maíz destinados al pollo, procurando incorporar todo el almidón a una película fina. No añadas huevo, harina, sal ni marinada. Mantén refrigerado hasta cocinar y separa el pollo en dos tandas de 300 g. Lava y desinfecta después tabla, cuchillo y superficies según sus materiales. Cambia de utensilios o límpialos correctamente antes de tocar lo cocinado.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Corta y cubre el pollo con almidón"},{"title":"Prepara la salsa y la suspensión por separado","content":"En un cuenco limpio mezcla 80 g de kétchup, 40 g de vinagre blanco alimentario de acidez 5 %, 30 g de azúcar, 20 g de salsa de soja con trigo tipo shoyu normal y 120 ml de agua potable. Pesa vinagre y soja en gramos, sin suponer que esos pesos son el mismo número de mililitros. En otro cuenco mezcla los 10 g restantes de almidón de maíz con 30 ml de agua fría hasta quitar grumos. El agua total es 150 ml y el almidón total 30 g, repartidos entre pollo y salsa. Incorpora luego toda la salsa y toda la suspensión; no se plantea una porción sobrante. No sustituyas soja normal por baja en sodio sin revisar valores. La soja contiene soja y trigo; revisa etiquetas del kétchup y el almidón.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Prepara la salsa y la suspensión por separado"},{"title":"Cocina el pollo en dos tandas","content":"Precalienta la sartén vacía durante unos 2 minutos a fuego medio alto, sin dejarla humear; esta espera está incluida en el total. Añade 10 g del aceite y coloca la primera tanda de 300 g de pollo en una sola capa. Cocina unos 7 minutos, girando para dorar caras y alcanzar al menos 74 °C en el centro de los dados más gruesos, medidos con termómetro limpio. El dorado no demuestra seguridad. Pasa a un plato limpio con utensilio para cocinado. Repite con otros 10 g de aceite y los 300 g restantes durante unos 7 minutos y comprueba también 74 °C. Las dos tandas suman 14 minutos previstos; prolonga si hace falta y registra la demora. No llenes la sartén de golpe ni descartes grasa, jugos o película de almidón adherida: quedan en la salsa. Si se quema, no ocultes el cambio como si la fórmula se hubiera cumplido.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Cocina el pollo en dos tandas"},{"title":"Saltea verduras y piña","content":"En la misma sartén incorpora los 10 g de aceite restantes. Añade cebolla, pimientos rojo y verde y piña, todos preparados, y saltea durante unos 5 minutos a fuego medio alto, moviendo con utensilio limpio. Busca bordes ligeramente dorados y pimiento todavía reconocible, sin volverlo puré. No añadas aceite extra ni deseches los jugos; la salsa del siguiente paso recogerá el fondo. Los 30 g de aceite completos se cuentan en la estimación, sin inventar absorción ni pérdida medida. Mantén aparte el pollo ya cocinado en su plato limpio, sin mezclarlo con cuencos o pinzas de crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Saltea verduras y piña"},{"title":"Cuece y espesa la salsa","content":"Remueve otra vez la suspensión de almidón para levantar lo que se haya depositado. Vierte toda la salsa preparada sobre verduras y piña y remueve para recoger el fondo de la sartén. Cuando empiece a hervir suavemente, incorpora toda la suspensión poco a poco mientras remueves y cocina unos 3 minutos a fuego medio. Busca una salsa brillante que cubra la espátula, sin sabor a almidón crudo ni grumos secos. No reduzcas hasta convertirla en caramelo espeso ni añadas más azúcar, agua o espesante a esta fórmula sin registrar la variación. La cantidad de agua inicial no es el peso final de salsa: parte se evapora y no se afirma un rendimiento cocinado medido.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Cuece y espesa la salsa"},{"title":"Integra el pollo y comprueba el acabado","content":"Devuelve todo el pollo cocinado y sus jugos del plato limpio a la sartén. Mezcla durante unos 2 minutos a fuego medio para repartir la salsa alrededor de los dados, la piña y las verduras. Comprueba con termómetro limpio al menos 74 °C en los trozos más gruesos antes de servir, prolongando si hace falta. No reincorpores ningún jugo, cuenco o utensilio de pollo crudo. Mantén los trozos reconocibles y no añadas sésamo, cebollín, cilantro, arroz ni otras guarniciones dentro de estas cifras. Es un acabado a la sartén con película fina de almidón, no una promesa de corteza crujiente de doble fritura.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Integra el pollo y comprueba el acabado"},{"title":"Sirve y conserva con seguridad","content":"Reparte en 4 porciones similares incluyendo todo el pollo, verduras, piña y salsa. No se afirma un peso servido medido. Se proponen 25 minutos de preparación, 24 de cocción y 2 de precalentamiento, total 51 minutos: pollo 14, verduras 5, salsa 3 y acabado 2, sin marinado ni reposo obligatorio. Registra demoras reales y descongelado adicional. Sirve enseguida; arroz u otros acompañamientos se calculan aparte. Refrigera sobrantes en recipientes poco profundos antes de 2 horas fuera del frío, o 1 hora por encima de 32 °C; descarta si se supera. Conserva a 4 °C o menos y consume dentro de 3 días como propuesta conservadora, no vida útil ensayada; recalienta a 74 °C. Contiene soja y trigo por shoyu y azúcares añadidos; no se presenta como sin gluten, sin azúcar ni plato terapéutico.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén: Sirve y conserva con seguridad"}],"notes":"Versión original a la sartén de pollo agridulce con piña fresca y pimientos, sin fritura profunda ni rebozado grueso. No se afirma la textura crujiente de restaurante. Pesa pechuga cruda sin piel, hueso ni solución añadida; la ficha USDA corresponde a ese producto, no a pollo con salmuera. Mantén crudo separado, no lo laves y comprueba 74°C con termómetro, no por el dorado. Si parte de congelado, descongela en frigorífico y suma el tiempo real. El almidón 30 g se divide 20 g para pollo y 10 g para salsa; el agua 150 ml se divide 120 ml en salsa y 30 ml en suspensión. Aceite 30 g en tres usos de 10 g: dos tandas de pollo y verduras. Se incorpora todo, incluidos jugos de pollo cocinado y fondo; no se inventa absorción o grasa descartada. Salsa de soja normal shoyu contiene soja y trigo; la receta no es sin gluten. Kétchup y azúcar aportan azúcares añadidos; no es sin azúcar. Piña fresca no equivale nutricionalmente a almíbar. Cambiar soja, fruta, aceite o añadir ingredientes exige cantidades registradas y recalcular. No añadas huevo, harina, salsa de ostras, ajo, jengibre, sésamo o adornos a esta fórmula. Cuatro porciones y 51 minutos son propuestos, sin prueba de cocina. Refrigera en recipientes poco profundos a 4°C o menos antes de 2 horas fuera del frío, o 1 hora por encima de 32°C; descarta lo que exceda. Consume dentro de 3 días como propuesta conservadora, no vida útil ensayada. Recalienta a 74°C. Arroz y acompañamientos se calculan aparte.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"pechuga cruda sin solución añadida","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"almidón de maíz total, incorporado completo","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceite de canola total, sin pérdida inventada","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"piña fresca limpia","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimiento rojo limpio","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimiento verde limpio","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebolla pelada","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"kétchup normal","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinagre blanco destilado alimentario","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"azúcar blanco","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"shoyu normal con trigo","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"La cuarta parte de pollo, verduras, piña y toda la salsa; 4 porciones propuestas","method":"Once fichas USDA verificadas. Multiplica cada valor por 100 g por los gramos comestibles incorporados, suma y divide entre 4. Pechuga cruda FDC 171077 sin solución añadida, no ficha con salmuera; fruta/verduras netas crudas, almidón 30 g total y aceite 30 g total. Todos los jugos, salsa y almidón se sirven. Agua 150 ml sin energía; evaporación no se convierte en pérdida de nutrientes.","note":"Estimación por ingredientes, no análisis ni prueba de cocina. No se inventa absorción o pérdida de aceite: los 30 g se cuentan completos. Piña fresca, no almíbar; shoyu normal con trigo, no reducido en sodio. No se descartan jugos de pollo cocinado ni salsa. Los pesos finales tras evaporación y las 4 raciones están pendientes de confirmar; no se presenta un peso servido medido. Arroz, sésamo, cebollín y guarniciones fuera del cálculo. Los 8 campos están presentes en las 11 fichas; ausencia de datos no se rellena con cero."},"keywords":["pollo agridulce","pollo con piña","pollo agridulce a la sartén","salsa agridulce casera"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Pollo agridulce con piña: receta a la sartén paso a paso","description":"Pollo agridulce a la sartén con piña fresca y pimientos. Cuatro porciones propuestas, salsa medida, cocción segura con termómetro y nutrición estimada USDA.","image_alt":"Dados de pollo a la sartén con piña, pimientos rojos y verdes y cebolla, cubiertos de salsa agridulce brillante sin arroz ni adornos","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"¿Queda crujiente como una doble fritura?","a":"No se promete esa textura. Esta propuesta usa película fina de almidón y aceite medido a la sartén, sin masa húmeda ni baño de fritura. Mantén las tandas separadas y sirve tras integrar la salsa; el dorado no sustituye comprobar 74°C."},{"q":"¿Puedo usar piña en almíbar o soja baja en sodio?","a":"Son variantes posibles con cantidades y valores revisados. La fórmula calcula piña fresca neta y shoyu normal con trigo. Cambiar almíbar, soja, azúcar u otros ingredientes requiere recalcular, y no convierte automáticamente el plato en sin gluten o sin azúcar."},{"q":"¿Cómo reparto el almidón y guardo sobrantes?","a":"Usa 20 g con el pollo y 10 g en 30 ml de agua fría para espesar, además de 120 ml de agua en la salsa. Refrigera en recipientes poco profundos a 4°C o menos dentro de los límites indicados, consume en 3 días como propuesta conservadora no ensayada y recalienta a 74°C. Arroz y guarniciones no están incluidos."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Pollo agridulce a la sartén con piña fresca, pimientos y salsa de kétchup, vinagre y soja. Cuatro porciones en 51 minutos propuestos, sin marinado ni fritura profunda, con termómetro y nutrición estimada trazable USDA; rendimiento y prueba de cocina no confirmados.</p><p>Versión original a la sartén de pollo agridulce con piña fresca y pimientos, sin fritura profunda ni rebozado grueso. No se afirma la textura crujiente de restaurante. Pesa pechuga cruda sin piel, hueso ni solución añadida; la ficha USDA corresponde a ese producto, no a pollo con salmuera. Mantén crudo separado, no lo laves y comprueba 74°C con termómetro, no por el dorado. Si parte de congelado, descongela en frigorífico y suma el tiempo real. El almidón 30 g se divide 20 g para pollo y 10 g para salsa; el agua 150 ml se divide 120 ml en salsa y 30 ml en suspensión. Aceite 30 g en tres usos de 10 g: dos tandas de pollo y verduras. Se incorpora todo, incluidos jugos de pollo cocinado y fondo; no se inventa absorción o grasa descartada. Salsa de soja normal shoyu contiene soja y trigo; la receta no es sin gluten. Kétchup y azúcar aportan azúcares añadidos; no es sin azúcar. Piña fresca no equivale nutricionalmente a almíbar. Cambiar soja, fruta, aceite o añadir ingredientes exige cantidades registradas y recalcular. No añadas huevo, harina, salsa de ostras, ajo, jengibre, sésamo o adornos a esta fórmula. Cuatro porciones y 51 minutos son propuestos, sin prueba de cocina. Refrigera en recipientes poco profundos a 4°C o menos antes de 2 horas fuera del frío, o 1 hora por encima de 32°C; descarta lo que exceda. Consume dentro de 3 días como propuesta conservadora, no vida útil ensayada. Recalienta a 74°C. Arroz y acompañamientos se calculan aparte.</p>"},{"id":"2accfe9a-ce60-5137-a9b2-f0c0af2957dc","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"suesssaures-haehnchen","public_path":"/de/suesssaures-haehnchen","source_url":null,"language":"de","title":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas","excerpt":"Hähnchenbrust, frische Ananas und Paprika mit abgemessener süßsaurer Sauce. Vier vorgeschlagene Portionen, Thermometerkontrolle und geschätzte Nährwerte.","summary":"Eine eigenständig entwickelte Pfannenvariante mit Ananas und Paprika, ohne Frittieren und dicken Teigmantel. Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen in 51 Minuten; Zeit und Ausbeute sind noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.","category":"Hauptgerichte","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Mittel","course":"Hauptgericht","cuisine":"Chinesisch-amerikanisch inspiriert","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut, Knochen oder zugesetzte Lake","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Hähnchen"},{"name":"Maisstärke für das Hähnchen","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Hähnchen"},{"name":"Rapsöl für beide Fleischportionen und das Gemüse","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Pfanne"},{"name":"frische Ananas, geschält und ohne harten Strunk","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse und Obst"},{"name":"rote Paprika ohne Kerne und Stiel","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse und Obst"},{"name":"grüne Paprika ohne Kerne und Stiel","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse und Obst"},{"name":"geschälte Zwiebel","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Gemüse und Obst"},{"name":"normaler Tomatenketchup","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"weißer Speiseessig mit 5% Säure","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"weißer Kristallzucker","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"normale Shoyu-Sojasauce aus Soja und Weizen","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Trinkwasser für Sauce und Stärkemischung","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"Maisstärke zum Binden der Sauce","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Vorbereiten und rohe von gegarten Lebensmitteln trennen","content":"Eine breite schwere Pfanne, Lebensmittelthermometer, Waage, Schüsseln, zwei Bretter und getrennte Utensilien für rohes und gegartes Fleisch bereitlegen. 600 g rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut, Knochen und zugesetzte Lake abwiegen, bei höchstens 4°C halten und nicht waschen. Gefrorenes Fleisch sicher im Kühlschrank auftauen und diese Zeit zusätzlich erfassen. Hände mindestens 20 Sekunden mit Seife waschen; Obst und Gemüse vor dem Schneiden mit Trinkwasser, ohne Seife oder Bleichmittel, abspülen. Es gelten essbare Nettogewichte. Dies ist eine Pfannenvariante mit dünnem Stärkefilm, kein Frittierteig.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Vorbereiten und rohe von gegarten Lebensmitteln trennen"},{"title":"Ananas und Gemüse schneiden","content":"Mit sauberem Gemüsebrett und Messer 200 g geschälte Ananas ohne harten Strunk, 150 g rote Paprika, 100 g grüne Paprika und 120 g geschälte Zwiebel vorbereiten. Kerne und Stiele entfernen und alles in etwa 2 cm große Stücke schneiden. Von rohem Fleisch und dessen Utensilien fernhalten. Schalen, Kerne, Abschnitte und Waschwasser zählen nicht zu den Nährwertgewichten. Ananas in Sirup, deren Saft sowie zusätzliches Gemüse oder Garnituren verändern die Rezeptur und erfordern eine Neuberechnung.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Ananas und Gemüse schneiden"},{"title":"Hähnchen schneiden und dünn mit Stärke überziehen","content":"Die 600 g Hähnchen auf dem separaten Rohfleischbrett in etwa 2 cm große Würfel schneiden. Falls nötig mit Einwegpapier trockentupfen, ohne es zu waschen. Sämtliche 20 g für das Fleisch bestimmten Stärke als dünnen Film untermischen. Kein Ei, Mehl, Salz oder Marinade hinzufügen. In zwei Portionen zu 300 g teilen und bis zum Garen kühlen. Brett, Messer und Oberflächen materialgerecht reinigen und desinfizieren; Utensilien vor Kontakt mit Gegartem wechseln oder gründlich reinigen.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Hähnchen schneiden und dünn mit Stärke überziehen"},{"title":"Sauce und Stärkemischung getrennt anrühren","content":"In einer sauberen Schüssel 80 g Ketchup, 40 g weißen Speiseessig mit 5% Säure, 30 g Zucker, 20 g normale Shoyu aus Soja und Weizen sowie 120 ml Wasser mischen. Essig und Sojasauce in Gramm abwiegen, nicht mit derselben Milliliterzahl gleichsetzen. Separat die übrigen 10 g Stärke mit 30 ml kaltem Wasser klümpchenfrei verrühren. Insgesamt werden 150 ml Wasser und 30 g Stärke verwendet. Sauce und Stärkemischung vollständig zugeben. Salzreduzierte Sojasauce erfordert neue Nährwerte; Allergene auf den Etiketten prüfen.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Sauce und Stärkemischung getrennt anrühren"},{"title":"Hähnchen in zwei Durchgängen garen","content":"Die Pfanne bei mittlerer bis hoher Hitze etwa 2 Minuten ohne Rauchentwicklung vorheizen; dies ist in der Gesamtzeit enthalten. 10 g Öl und eine Lage von 300 g Fleisch hineingeben. Etwa 7 Minuten unter Wenden garen, bis die dicksten Würfel mit sauberem Thermometer mindestens 74°C erreichen. Mit Utensilien für gegarte Lebensmittel auf einen sauberen Teller legen. Mit weiteren 10 g Öl und den übrigen 300 g Fleisch etwa 7 Minuten wiederholen und erneut 74°C prüfen. Vorgeschlagen sind zusammen 14 Minuten; nötige Mehrzeit erfassen. Bräunung beweist keine sichere Temperatur. Öl, gegarte Säfte und Stärkerückstände für die Sauce behalten; angebranntes Essen nicht als unveränderte Rezeptur ausgeben.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Hähnchen in zwei Durchgängen garen"},{"title":"Gemüse und Ananas anbraten","content":"Die letzten 10 g Öl in dieselbe Pfanne geben. Vorbereitete Zwiebel, rote und grüne Paprika sowie Ananas bei mittlerer bis hoher Hitze etwa 5 Minuten mit sauberem Utensil anbraten. Leicht gebräunte Ränder und erkennbare Stücke anstreben, kein Püree. Kein zusätzliches Öl zugeben und keine Säfte wegschütten; die Sauce löst später den Pfannenansatz. Alle 30 g Öl zählen zur Schätzung, ohne erfundene Aufnahme oder gemessene Verluste. Gegartes Fleisch auf seinem sauberen Teller getrennt halten.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Gemüse und Ananas anbraten"},{"title":"Sauce aufkochen und binden","content":"Abgesetzte Stärke erneut in der kalten Mischung aufrühren. Die gesamte vorbereitete Sauce über Gemüse und Ananas gießen und den Pfannenansatz lösen. Beim sanften Köcheln die gesamte Stärkemischung unter Rühren langsam zugeben und etwa 3 Minuten bei mittlerer Hitze garen. Die Sauce soll glänzen und den Pfannenwender überziehen, ohne rohe Stärke oder trockene Klümpchen. Nicht zu dickem Karamell einkochen und keine zusätzlichen Zutaten ohne Erfassung zugeben. Durch Verdunstung entspricht die anfängliche Wassermenge keiner gemessenen fertigen Saucenmenge.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Sauce aufkochen und binden"},{"title":"Hähnchen unterheben und Temperatur prüfen","content":"Sämtliches gegartes Fleisch samt Säften vom sauberen Teller zurückgeben. Bei mittlerer Hitze etwa 2 Minuten mit Sauce, Ananas und Gemüse vermengen. Die dicksten Würfel mit sauberem Thermometer auf mindestens 74°C prüfen und bei Bedarf länger erhitzen. Keine rohen Fleischsäfte oder deren Utensilien verwenden. Die Stücke erhalten; Sesam, Frühlingszwiebeln, Koriander, Reis und andere Beilagen gehören nicht zu diesen Nährwerten. Ein dünner Stärkefilm verspricht keine Knusprigkeit wie zweimaliges Frittieren.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Hähnchen unterheben und Temperatur prüfen"},{"title":"Servieren und sicher aufbewahren","content":"Alles einschließlich Sauce in 4 ähnliche Portionen teilen; kein gemessenes Portionsgewicht behaupten. Vorgeschlagen sind 25 Minuten Vorbereitung, 24 Garen und 2 Vorheizen, insgesamt 51 Minuten: Fleisch 14, Gemüse 5, Sauce 3 und Fertigstellen 2. Kein Marinieren oder verpflichtendes Ruhen; tatsächliche Verzögerungen und Auftauzeit ergänzen. Sofort servieren und Reis separat berechnen. Reste binnen 2 Stunden, bei über 32°C binnen 1 Stunde, flach verpackt auf höchstens 4°C kühlen; Überschreitungen erfordern Entsorgung. Innerhalb vorgeschlagener, nicht getesteter 3 Tage verbrauchen und auf 74°C erhitzen. Shoyu enthält Soja und Weizen, die Sauce zugesetzten Zucker.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Süßsaures Hähnchen aus der Pfanne mit Ananas: Servieren und sicher aufbewahren"}],"notes":"Rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut, Knochen und zugesetzte Lake verwenden; der USDA-Eintrag gilt nicht für gepökeltes Fleisch. Rohes Geflügel getrennt halten, nicht waschen und 74°C mit sauberem Lebensmittelthermometer prüfen. Tiefgefrorenes Fleisch sicher im Kühlschrank auftauen und die tatsächliche Zeit zusätzlich erfassen. Insgesamt 30 g Stärke verteilen: 20 g fürs Hähnchen und 10 g für die Sauce. Von 150 ml Wasser gehen 120 ml in die Sauce und 30 ml in die Stärkemischung. Die 30 g Öl in drei Portionen zu 10 g verwenden und sämtliche gegarten Fleischsäfte, Pfannenrückstände und Sauce mitservieren; keine Ölaufnahme oder Fettverluste erfinden. Normale Shoyu enthält Soja und Weizen; das Gericht ist nicht glutenfrei. Ketchup und Zucker liefern zugesetzten Zucker. Frische Ananas ist nicht mit Ananas in Sirup gleichzusetzen. Änderungen und Beilagen mit Mengen erfassen und neu berechnen. Keine Eier, Mehl, Austernsauce, Knoblauch, Ingwer, Sesam oder Garnitur hinzufügen. Vier Portionen und 51 Minuten sind Vorschläge, keine getesteten Werte. Reste binnen 2 Stunden, bei über 32°C binnen 1 Stunde, in flachen Behältern auf höchstens 4°C kühlen; bei Überschreitung entsorgen. Innerhalb vorgeschlagener 3 Tage verbrauchen und auf 74°C erhitzen; die Haltbarkeit ist nicht untersucht. Reis und Beilagen werden separat berechnet.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne zugesetzte Lake","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"gesamte 30 g Maisstärke vollständig eingearbeitet","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"gesamte 30 g Rapsöl ohne angenommene Verluste","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"frische geputzte Ananas","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geputzte rote Paprika","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geputzte grüne Paprika","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"geschälte Zwiebel","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"normaler Ketchup","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"weißer destillierter Speiseessig","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"weißer Zucker","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"normale Shoyu aus Soja und Weizen","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Ein Viertel von Fleisch, Gemüse, Ananas und gesamter Sauce; 4 vorgeschlagene Portionen","method":"Elf geprüfte USDA-Einträge: Werte je 100 g mit essbaren eingearbeiteten Gramm multiplizieren, addieren und durch 4 teilen. Rohe Brust FDC 171077 ohne zugesetzte Lake, rohes Gemüse und Obst als Nettogewichte, sämtliche 30 g Stärke und 30 g Öl einschließlich gegarter Säfte und Sauce. 150 ml Wasser liefern keine Energie; Verdunstung ist kein Nährstoffverlust.","note":"Zutatenbasierte Schätzung, keine Laboranalyse oder Küchenprüfung. Keine erfundene Ölaufnahme oder Verluste. Frische Ananas und normale weizenhaltige Shoyu; fertige Gewichte und 4 Portionen noch unbestätigt. Reis, Sesam, Frühlingszwiebeln und Beilagen ausgeschlossen. Alle 8 Nährwertfelder liegen in allen 11 Einträgen vor; fehlende Daten werden nicht als null erfunden."},"keywords":["süßsaures Hähnchen","Ananas","Pfannenhähnchen","Paprika"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Süßsaures Hähnchen mit Ananas: Pfannenrezept","description":"Hähnchenbrust, frische Ananas und Paprika mit abgemessener süßsaurer Sauce. Vier vorgeschlagene Portionen, Thermometerkontrolle und geschätzte Nährwerte.","image_alt":"Hähnchenwürfel aus der Pfanne mit Ananas, roter und grüner Paprika und Zwiebel in glänzender süßsaurer Sauce","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Wird es so knusprig wie zweimal frittiertes Hähnchen?","a":"Das wird nicht versprochen. Ein dünner Stärkefilm und abgemessenes Pfannenöl ersetzen keinen feuchten Frittierteig. In getrennten Portionen garen, nach dem Vermengen servieren und unabhängig von der Bräunung 74°C prüfen."},{"q":"Kann ich Ananas in Sirup oder salzreduzierte Sojasauce verwenden?","a":"Als erfasste Variante mit angepassten Mengen und Nährwerten. Berechnet werden frische Ananas mit Nettogewicht und normale Shoyu mit Weizen. Ein Austausch macht das Gericht nicht automatisch glutenfrei oder zuckerfrei."},{"q":"Wie teile ich die Stärke auf und lagere Reste?","a":"20 g fürs Fleisch, 10 g in 30 ml kaltem Wasser zum Binden sowie 120 ml Wasser in der Sauce. Flache Behälter innerhalb der genannten Grenzen auf höchstens 4°C kühlen, innerhalb vorgeschlagener 3 Tage verbrauchen und auf 74°C erhitzen. Beilagen sind nicht enthalten."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Eine eigenständig entwickelte Pfannenvariante mit Ananas und Paprika, ohne Frittieren und dicken Teigmantel. Vorgeschlagen sind 4 Portionen in 51 Minuten; Zeit und Ausbeute sind noch nicht durch einen Küchentest bestätigt.</p><p>Rohe Hähnchenbrust ohne Haut, Knochen und zugesetzte Lake verwenden; der USDA-Eintrag gilt nicht für gepökeltes Fleisch. Rohes Geflügel getrennt halten, nicht waschen und 74°C mit sauberem Lebensmittelthermometer prüfen. Tiefgefrorenes Fleisch sicher im Kühlschrank auftauen und die tatsächliche Zeit zusätzlich erfassen. Insgesamt 30 g Stärke verteilen: 20 g fürs Hähnchen und 10 g für die Sauce. Von 150 ml Wasser gehen 120 ml in die Sauce und 30 ml in die Stärkemischung. Die 30 g Öl in drei Portionen zu 10 g verwenden und sämtliche gegarten Fleischsäfte, Pfannenrückstände und Sauce mitservieren; keine Ölaufnahme oder Fettverluste erfinden. Normale Shoyu enthält Soja und Weizen; das Gericht ist nicht glutenfrei. Ketchup und Zucker liefern zugesetzten Zucker. Frische Ananas ist nicht mit Ananas in Sirup gleichzusetzen. Änderungen und Beilagen mit Mengen erfassen und neu berechnen. Keine Eier, Mehl, Austernsauce, Knoblauch, Ingwer, Sesam oder Garnitur hinzufügen. Vier Portionen und 51 Minuten sind Vorschläge, keine getesteten Werte. Reste binnen 2 Stunden, bei über 32°C binnen 1 Stunde, in flachen Behältern auf höchstens 4°C kühlen; bei Überschreitung entsorgen. Innerhalb vorgeschlagener 3 Tage verbrauchen und auf 74°C erhitzen; die Haltbarkeit ist nicht untersucht. Reis und Beilagen werden separat berechnet.</p>"},{"id":"381d3ddc-54fe-5442-a0e6-d235523c718a","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"sweet-and-sour-chicken","public_path":"/en/sweet-and-sour-chicken","source_url":null,"language":"en","title":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple","excerpt":"Pan-seared chicken with fresh pineapple, peppers and a measured sweet-and-sour sauce. Four proposed portions, thermometer checks and estimated nutrition.","summary":"An original pan version of sweet-and-sour chicken with fresh pineapple and peppers, without deep-frying or a thick batter. The proposed recipe makes 4 portions in 51 minutes; timing and yield have not been kitchen-tested.","category":"Main dishes","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Medium","course":"Main course","cuisine":"Chinese-American inspired","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"raw boneless, skinless chicken breast without added solution","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Chicken"},{"name":"cornstarch for the chicken","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Chicken"},{"name":"canola oil for both chicken batches and vegetables","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Pan"},{"name":"fresh pineapple, peeled and hard core removed","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables and fruit"},{"name":"red bell pepper, stem and seeds removed","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables and fruit"},{"name":"green bell pepper, stem and seeds removed","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables and fruit"},{"name":"peeled onion","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Vegetables and fruit"},{"name":"regular tomato ketchup","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"food-grade white vinegar, 5% acidity","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"white granulated sugar","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"regular soy-and-wheat shoyu sauce","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"drinking water for sauce and slurry","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"cornstarch for thickening the sauce","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Prepare and separate raw and cooked food","content":"Set out a wide heavy pan, food thermometer, scales, bowls, two boards and separate utensils for raw and cooked chicken. Weigh 600 g raw boneless, skinless breast without added solution. Keep it at 4°C or below and do not wash it. If frozen, thaw safely in the refrigerator and add the actual thawing time. Wash hands with soap for at least 20 seconds; rinse produce with drinking water before cutting, without soap or bleach. Produce weights are edible net weights. This method uses a pan and a thin starch coating, not a deep-fried batter.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Prepare and separate raw and cooked food"},{"title":"Cut the pineapple and vegetables","content":"Using a clean produce board and knife, prepare 200 g fresh peeled pineapple without hard core, 150 g red pepper, 100 g green pepper and 120 g peeled onion. Remove pepper seeds and stems, and cut everything into approximately 2 cm pieces. Keep away from raw chicken and its utensils. Do not include peel, seeds, cores, trimmings or washing water in the nutrition weights. Syrup-packed pineapple or its juice changes the formula; do not add carrots, broccoli or garnish without recalculating.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Cut the pineapple and vegetables"},{"title":"Cut and lightly coat the chicken","content":"On the separate raw-meat board, cut 600 g chicken into approximately 2 cm cubes. Pat dry with disposable paper if necessary, without washing the chicken. Toss with all 20 g cornstarch reserved for chicken, forming a thin film. Add no egg, flour, salt or marinade. Divide into two 300 g batches and refrigerate until cooking. Clean and disinfect the board, knife and surfaces appropriately, and change or clean utensils before touching cooked food.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Cut and lightly coat the chicken"},{"title":"Mix the sauce and slurry separately","content":"In a clean bowl mix 80 g ketchup, 40 g food-grade white vinegar of 5% acidity, 30 g sugar, 20 g regular soy-and-wheat shoyu and 120 ml water. Weigh vinegar and soy sauce in grams rather than assuming an equal volume in millilitres. In another bowl mix the remaining 10 g cornstarch with 30 ml cold water until smooth. The totals are 150 ml water and 30 g cornstarch. Use all sauce and slurry. Reduced-sodium soy sauce requires a new calculation; check labels for soy, wheat and other allergens.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Mix the sauce and slurry separately"},{"title":"Cook the chicken in two batches","content":"Preheat the pan over medium-high heat for about 2 minutes without letting it smoke; this time is included in the total. Add 10 g oil and arrange one 300 g chicken batch in a single layer. Cook for about 7 minutes, turning to brown, until the thickest cubes reach at least 74°C on a clean thermometer. Transfer with cooked-food utensils to a clean plate. Repeat with another 10 g oil and the remaining 300 g chicken for about 7 minutes, checking 74°C again. The proposed total is 14 minutes; extend and record it if necessary. Browning does not establish safety. Retain oil, cooked juices and starch residue for the sauce; do not conceal burning as an unchanged formula.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Cook the chicken in two batches"},{"title":"Sauté vegetables and pineapple","content":"Add the final 10 g oil to the same pan. Add the prepared onion, red and green peppers and pineapple, and stir with a clean utensil over medium-high heat for about 5 minutes. Aim for lightly browned edges and recognisable pepper pieces, not a purée. Do not add oil or discard juices; the next step collects the pan residue. All 30 g oil are included in the estimate, without invented absorption or measured loss. Keep cooked chicken on its clean plate, away from raw-food bowls and utensils.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Sauté vegetables and pineapple"},{"title":"Cook and thicken the sauce","content":"Stir the slurry again to lift settled starch. Pour all prepared sauce over the vegetables and pineapple, and stir to loosen the pan residue. When gently simmering, gradually add all the slurry while stirring, then cook over medium heat for about 3 minutes. The sauce should become glossy and coat the spatula without raw starch taste or dry lumps. Do not reduce to a thick caramel or add sugar, water or thickener without recording a change. Evaporation means the starting water quantity is not a measured finished sauce yield.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Cook and thicken the sauce"},{"title":"Return the chicken and check the finish","content":"Return all cooked chicken and the juices from its clean plate to the pan. Fold through the sauce, pineapple and vegetables over medium heat for about 2 minutes. Check that the thickest chicken cubes reach at least 74°C with a clean thermometer; extend cooking if needed. Never add raw chicken juices or utensils. Keep pieces recognisable and add no sesame, scallions, cilantro, rice or other sides within these nutrition figures. This is a thin-coated pan dish, not a promise of twice-fried crispness.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Return the chicken and check the finish"},{"title":"Serve and store safely","content":"Divide all chicken, vegetables, pineapple and sauce into 4 similar portions; no measured serving weight is claimed. Proposed timing is 25 minutes preparation, 24 cooking and 2 preheating, total 51 minutes: chicken 14, vegetables 5, sauce 3 and finishing 2. There is no required marinade or rest. Record actual delays and extra thawing time. Serve promptly and calculate rice separately. Refrigerate leftovers in shallow containers within 2 hours, or 1 hour above 32°C; discard beyond those limits. Keep at 4°C or below and use within 3 days as a conservative, untested proposal. Reheat to 74°C. Shoyu contributes soy and wheat, and the sauce contains added sugars.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Pan-seared sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: Serve and store safely"}],"notes":"Use raw boneless, skinless chicken breast without added solution; the USDA entry does not describe brined chicken. Keep raw poultry separate, do not wash it, and check 74°C with a clean food thermometer. Thaw frozen chicken safely in the refrigerator and add that time separately. Divide 30 g cornstarch into 20 g for chicken and 10 g for sauce; divide 150 ml water into 120 ml for sauce and 30 ml for slurry. Use all 30 g oil in three 10 g additions and include all cooked chicken juices, pan residue and sauce. No oil absorption or discarded fat is assumed. Regular shoyu contains soy and wheat, so this is not a gluten-free recipe. Ketchup and sugar add sugars; fresh pineapple is not nutritionally interchangeable with syrup-packed fruit. Record changes to sauce, fruit, oil or added ingredients and recalculate nutrition. Do not add eggs, flour, oyster sauce, garlic, ginger, sesame or garnish to this formula. Four portions and 51 minutes are proposals, not a kitchen test. Refrigerate in shallow containers at 4°C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour above 32°C; discard food exceeding those limits. Use within 3 days as a conservative proposal, not a tested shelf life, and reheat to 74°C. Rice and accompaniments are calculated separately.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"raw chicken breast without added solution","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"all 30 g cornstarch, fully incorporated","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"all 30 g canola oil, no assumed loss","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"fresh cleaned pineapple","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cleaned red pepper","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cleaned green pepper","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peeled onion","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"regular ketchup","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"food-grade distilled white vinegar","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"white sugar","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"regular soy-and-wheat shoyu","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"One quarter of all chicken, vegetables, pineapple and sauce; 4 proposed portions","method":"Eleven verified USDA entries: multiply each per-100 g value by incorporated edible grams, add and divide by 4. Chicken is raw breast FDC 171077 without added solution. Use net raw produce, all 30 g starch and all 30 g oil, including cooked juices and sauce. The 150 ml water adds no energy; evaporation is not nutrient loss.","note":"Ingredient-based estimate, not laboratory analysis or a kitchen test. No oil absorption or loss is invented. Fresh pineapple and regular wheat-containing shoyu are used; finished weights and 4 portions remain unconfirmed. Rice, sesame, scallions and sides are excluded. All 8 nutrient fields exist in all 11 entries; missing data are not filled with zero."},"keywords":["sweet-and-sour chicken","pineapple","pan-seared chicken","bell peppers"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Sweet-and-sour chicken with pineapple: pan recipe","description":"Pan-seared chicken with fresh pineapple, peppers and a measured sweet-and-sour sauce. Four proposed portions, thermometer checks and estimated nutrition.","image_alt":"Pan-seared chicken cubes, pineapple, red and green peppers and onion in glossy sweet-and-sour sauce","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Will it be as crisp as twice-fried chicken?","a":"That texture is not promised. This version uses a thin starch film and measured pan oil rather than wet batter or a deep oil bath. Cook in separate batches and serve after mixing in the sauce; browning never replaces the 74°C thermometer check."},{"q":"Can I use syrup-packed pineapple or reduced-sodium soy sauce?","a":"Yes, as a recorded variation with revised quantities and nutrition. This formula uses fresh net-weight pineapple and regular soy-and-wheat shoyu. Such substitutions do not automatically make the dish gluten-free or sugar-free."},{"q":"How do I divide the starch and store leftovers?","a":"Use 20 g starch with chicken and 10 g in 30 ml cold water for thickening, plus 120 ml water in the sauce. Refrigerate shallow containers at 4°C or below within the stated limits, use within a proposed 3 days, and reheat to 74°C. Rice and accompaniments are excluded."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>An original pan version of sweet-and-sour chicken with fresh pineapple and peppers, without deep-frying or a thick batter. The proposed recipe makes 4 portions in 51 minutes; timing and yield have not been kitchen-tested.</p><p>Use raw boneless, skinless chicken breast without added solution; the USDA entry does not describe brined chicken. Keep raw poultry separate, do not wash it, and check 74°C with a clean food thermometer. Thaw frozen chicken safely in the refrigerator and add that time separately. Divide 30 g cornstarch into 20 g for chicken and 10 g for sauce; divide 150 ml water into 120 ml for sauce and 30 ml for slurry. Use all 30 g oil in three 10 g additions and include all cooked chicken juices, pan residue and sauce. No oil absorption or discarded fat is assumed. Regular shoyu contains soy and wheat, so this is not a gluten-free recipe. Ketchup and sugar add sugars; fresh pineapple is not nutritionally interchangeable with syrup-packed fruit. Record changes to sauce, fruit, oil or added ingredients and recalculate nutrition. Do not add eggs, flour, oyster sauce, garlic, ginger, sesame or garnish to this formula. Four portions and 51 minutes are proposals, not a kitchen test. Refrigerate in shallow containers at 4°C or below within 2 hours, or 1 hour above 32°C; discard food exceeding those limits. Use within 3 days as a conservative proposal, not a tested shelf life, and reheat to 74°C. Rice and accompaniments are calculated separately.</p>"},{"id":"f5501d88-d5b9-5ef8-baaa-6ee22595f693","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"poulet-aigre-doux","public_path":"/fr/poulet-aigre-doux","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/fr/poulet-aigre-doux/","language":"fr","title":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons","excerpt":"Poulet, ananas frais et poivrons dans une sauce aigre-douce dosée. Quatre portions proposées, contrôle au thermomètre et nutrition estimée.","summary":"Une version originale à la poêle du poulet aigre-doux avec ananas frais et poivrons, sans friture profonde ni pâte épaisse. Les 4 portions et 51 minutes proposées restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.","category":"Plats principaux","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Moyenne","course":"Plat principal","cuisine":"Inspiration sino-américaine","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"blanc de poulet cru sans peau, os ni solution ajoutée","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Poulet"},{"name":"amidon de maïs pour le poulet","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Poulet"},{"name":"huile de colza pour les deux fournées de poulet et les légumes","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Poêle"},{"name":"ananas frais pelé, sans cœur dur","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Légumes et fruit"},{"name":"poivron rouge sans graines ni pédoncule","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Légumes et fruit"},{"name":"poivron vert sans graines ni pédoncule","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Légumes et fruit"},{"name":"oignon pelé","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Légumes et fruit"},{"name":"ketchup de tomate normal","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"vinaigre blanc alimentaire à 5% d’acidité","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"sucre blanc cristallisé","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"sauce shoyu normale à base de soja et de blé","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"eau potable pour sauce et suspension","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Sauce"},{"name":"amidon de maïs pour épaissir la sauce","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Sauce"}],"steps":[{"title":"Organiser et séparer cru et cuit","content":"Préparer une grande poêle à fond épais, un thermomètre alimentaire, une balance, des bols, deux planches et des ustensiles distincts pour le cru et le cuit. Peser 600 g de blanc cru sans peau, os ni solution ajoutée, conserver à 4°C maximum et ne pas laver. Décongeler si nécessaire au réfrigérateur en ajoutant ce temps réel. Se laver les mains au savon au moins 20 secondes ; rincer fruits et légumes à l’eau potable sans savon ni eau de Javel. Les poids sont nets et comestibles. Cette version à la poêle utilise une fine pellicule d’amidon, pas une pâte à frire.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Organiser et séparer cru et cuit"},{"title":"Couper l’ananas et les légumes","content":"Sur une planche propre dédiée aux végétaux, préparer 200 g d’ananas frais pelé sans cœur dur, 150 g de poivron rouge, 100 g de vert et 120 g d’oignon pelé. Retirer graines et pédoncules et couper en morceaux d’environ 2 cm. Éloigner du poulet cru et de ses ustensiles. Écorces, graines, parures et eau de lavage sont exclues des poids nutritionnels. Ananas au sirop, jus, légumes supplémentaires ou décoration modifient la formule et demandent un nouveau calcul.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Couper l’ananas et les légumes"},{"title":"Couper le poulet et l’enrober finement","content":"Sur la planche réservée au cru, couper les 600 g de poulet en dés d’environ 2 cm. Éponger au besoin avec du papier jetable, sans laver. Incorporer tous les 20 g d’amidon destinés au poulet en fine pellicule. Ne pas ajouter œuf, farine, sel ou marinade. Séparer en deux fournées de 300 g et réfrigérer jusqu’à cuisson. Nettoyer et désinfecter planche, couteau et surfaces selon leur matériau ; changer ou nettoyer les ustensiles avant de toucher le cuit.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Couper le poulet et l’enrober finement"},{"title":"Préparer sauce et suspension séparément","content":"Dans un bol propre, mélanger 80 g de ketchup, 40 g de vinaigre blanc alimentaire à 5%, 30 g de sucre, 20 g de shoyu normal avec blé et 120 ml d’eau. Peser vinaigre et soja en grammes, sans supposer un volume identique en millilitres. Dans un autre bol, délayer les 10 g d’amidon restants dans 30 ml d’eau froide sans grumeaux. Totaux : 150 ml d’eau et 30 g d’amidon. Utiliser toute la sauce et toute la suspension. Une sauce soja réduite en sodium exige un nouveau calcul ; vérifier les étiquettes et allergènes.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Préparer sauce et suspension séparément"},{"title":"Cuire le poulet en deux fournées","content":"Préchauffer la poêle environ 2 minutes à feu moyen-vif sans la faire fumer ; ce délai est inclus. Ajouter 10 g d’huile et étaler une fournée de 300 g en une couche. Cuire environ 7 minutes en retournant, jusqu’à au moins 74°C au centre des dés les plus épais, au thermomètre propre. Transférer sur une assiette propre avec les ustensiles du cuit. Répéter avec 10 g d’huile et les 300 g restants pendant environ 7 minutes et contrôler à nouveau 74°C. Les 14 minutes sont proposées : prolonger au besoin et noter. La coloration n’est pas une preuve de sécurité. Garder huile, jus cuits et amidon adhérent pour la sauce ; ne pas masquer une brûlure comme une formule inchangée.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Cuire le poulet en deux fournées"},{"title":"Faire sauter légumes et ananas","content":"Ajouter les derniers 10 g d’huile dans la même poêle, puis oignon, poivrons et ananas préparés. Faire sauter environ 5 minutes à feu moyen-vif avec un ustensile propre. Rechercher des bords légèrement dorés et des morceaux reconnaissables, pas une purée. Ne pas ajouter d’huile ni jeter les jus ; la sauce récupérera le fond. Les 30 g d’huile sont comptés intégralement, sans absorption ou perte inventée. Garder le poulet cuit sur son assiette propre, séparé des ustensiles du cru.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Faire sauter légumes et ananas"},{"title":"Cuire et épaissir la sauce","content":"Remuer de nouveau la suspension pour remettre l’amidon en mélange. Verser toute la sauce sur légumes et ananas et décoller le fond de poêle. Au frémissement, ajouter progressivement toute la suspension en remuant, puis cuire environ 3 minutes à feu moyen. Obtenir une sauce brillante qui nappe la spatule, sans goût d’amidon cru ni grumeaux secs. Ne pas réduire en caramel épais ni ajouter sucre, eau ou épaississant sans consigner la variation. L’eau initiale ne représente pas un poids final mesuré de sauce : une partie s’évapore.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Cuire et épaissir la sauce"},{"title":"Réunir le poulet et contrôler la cuisson","content":"Remettre tout le poulet cuit et les jus de son assiette propre dans la poêle. Mélanger avec sauce, ananas et légumes environ 2 minutes à feu moyen. Vérifier au moins 74°C dans les dés les plus épais avec un thermomètre propre ; prolonger si nécessaire. Ne jamais incorporer des jus ou ustensiles de poulet cru. Garder les morceaux reconnaissables et ne pas inclure sésame, oignon vert, coriandre, riz ou autres garnitures dans ces valeurs. La fine pellicule d’amidon ne promet pas le croustillant d’une double friture.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Réunir le poulet et contrôler la cuisson"},{"title":"Servir et conserver en sécurité","content":"Partager l’ensemble du poulet, des légumes, de l’ananas et de la sauce en 4 portions similaires, sans prétendre à un poids servi mesuré. Proposition : 25 minutes de préparation, 24 de cuisson et 2 de préchauffage, total 51 ; poulet 14, légumes 5, sauce 3, finition 2. Aucun repos ni marinade obligatoire. Ajouter les délais réels et la décongélation ; servir rapidement et calculer le riz à part. Réfrigérer les restes en récipients peu profonds avant 2 heures, ou 1 heure au-dessus de 32°C, sinon jeter. Maintenir à 4°C maximum, consommer sous 3 jours proposés non testés et réchauffer à 74°C. Le shoyu contient soja et blé, et la sauce des sucres ajoutés.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Poulet aigre-doux à la poêle, ananas et poivrons: Servir et conserver en sécurité"}],"notes":"Utiliser du blanc cru sans peau, os ni solution ajoutée ; la fiche USDA ne décrit pas du poulet saumuré. Séparer le cru du cuit, ne pas laver le poulet et vérifier 74°C avec un thermomètre propre. Décongeler au réfrigérateur et ajouter ce temps réel. Répartir les 30 g d’amidon : 20 g pour le poulet, 10 g pour la sauce ; les 150 ml d’eau : 120 ml pour la sauce, 30 ml pour la suspension. Incorporer les 30 g d’huile en trois ajouts de 10 g ainsi que tous les jus cuits, le fond de poêle et la sauce. Aucune absorption ou perte d’huile n’est inventée. Le shoyu normal contient soja et blé : la recette n’est pas sans gluten. Ketchup et sucre apportent des sucres ajoutés ; l’ananas frais n’équivaut pas à celui au sirop. Toute modification ou garniture exige des quantités consignées et un nouveau calcul. Ne pas ajouter œuf, farine, sauce d’huître, ail, gingembre, sésame ou décoration à cette formule. Les 4 portions et 51 minutes ne constituent pas un essai. Réfrigérer en récipients peu profonds à 4°C maximum avant 2 heures hors du froid, ou 1 heure au-dessus de 32°C ; jeter si ces limites sont dépassées. Consommer sous 3 jours comme proposition prudente, non une durée de conservation testée, et réchauffer à 74°C. Riz et accompagnements se calculent séparément.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"blanc cru sans solution ajoutée","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g d’amidon de maïs entièrement incorporés","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g d’huile de colza sans perte supposée","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ananas frais nettoyé","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"poivron rouge nettoyé","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"poivron vert nettoyé","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"oignon pelé","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ketchup normal","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinaigre blanc distillé alimentaire","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"sucre blanc","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"shoyu normal contenant soja et blé","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un quart du poulet, des légumes, de l’ananas et de toute la sauce ; 4 portions proposées","method":"Onze fiches USDA vérifiées : multiplier les valeurs pour 100 g par les grammes comestibles incorporés, additionner et diviser par 4. Blanc cru FDC 171077 sans solution ajoutée, végétaux nets crus, totalité des 30 g d’amidon et 30 g d’huile avec les jus cuits et la sauce. Les 150 ml d’eau n’apportent pas d’énergie ; évaporation n’est pas perte de nutriments.","note":"Estimation par ingrédients, ni analyse de laboratoire ni essai en cuisine. Aucune absorption ou perte d’huile inventée. Ananas frais et shoyu normal avec blé ; poids finis et 4 portions non confirmés. Riz, sésame, oignon vert et accompagnements exclus. Les 8 champs existent dans les 11 fiches ; les données absentes ne sont pas remplacées par zéro."},"keywords":["poulet aigre-doux","ananas","poulet à la poêle","poivrons"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Poulet aigre-doux à l’ananas : recette à la poêle","description":"Poulet, ananas frais et poivrons dans une sauce aigre-douce dosée. Quatre portions proposées, contrôle au thermomètre et nutrition estimée.","image_alt":"Dés de poulet à la poêle, ananas, poivrons rouges et verts et oignon dans une sauce aigre-douce brillante","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Le poulet sera-t-il croustillant comme après deux fritures ?","a":"Cette texture n’est pas promise. Fine pellicule d’amidon et huile mesurée à la poêle ne remplacent pas une pâte et un bain de friture. Cuire en deux fournées, servir après ajout de sauce et toujours vérifier 74°C, quelle que soit la coloration."},{"q":"Puis-je utiliser de l’ananas au sirop ou du soja réduit en sodium ?","a":"Comme variante consignée avec quantités et nutrition révisées. La formule utilise ananas frais net et shoyu normal contenant du blé. Ces substitutions ne rendent pas automatiquement le plat sans gluten ou sans sucre."},{"q":"Comment répartir l’amidon et garder les restes ?","a":"20 g pour le poulet et 10 g dans 30 ml d’eau froide pour épaissir, plus 120 ml d’eau dans la sauce. Refroidir en récipients peu profonds à 4°C maximum dans les limites indiquées, consommer sous 3 jours proposés et réchauffer à 74°C. Les accompagnements sont exclus."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Une version originale à la poêle du poulet aigre-doux avec ananas frais et poivrons, sans friture profonde ni pâte épaisse. Les 4 portions et 51 minutes proposées restent à confirmer par un essai en cuisine.</p><p>Utiliser du blanc cru sans peau, os ni solution ajoutée ; la fiche USDA ne décrit pas du poulet saumuré. Séparer le cru du cuit, ne pas laver le poulet et vérifier 74°C avec un thermomètre propre. Décongeler au réfrigérateur et ajouter ce temps réel. Répartir les 30 g d’amidon : 20 g pour le poulet, 10 g pour la sauce ; les 150 ml d’eau : 120 ml pour la sauce, 30 ml pour la suspension. Incorporer les 30 g d’huile en trois ajouts de 10 g ainsi que tous les jus cuits, le fond de poêle et la sauce. Aucune absorption ou perte d’huile n’est inventée. Le shoyu normal contient soja et blé : la recette n’est pas sans gluten. Ketchup et sucre apportent des sucres ajoutés ; l’ananas frais n’équivaut pas à celui au sirop. Toute modification ou garniture exige des quantités consignées et un nouveau calcul. Ne pas ajouter œuf, farine, sauce d’huître, ail, gingembre, sésame ou décoration à cette formule. Les 4 portions et 51 minutes ne constituent pas un essai. Réfrigérer en récipients peu profonds à 4°C maximum avant 2 heures hors du froid, ou 1 heure au-dessus de 32°C ; jeter si ces limites sont dépassées. Consommer sous 3 jours comme proposition prudente, non une durée de conservation testée, et réchauffer à 74°C. Riz et accompagnements se calculent séparément.</p>"},{"id":"2811c9fe-b42b-5b63-ad32-24f06a4e8f18","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"pollo-agrodolce","public_path":"/it/pollo-agrodolce","source_url":"https://manualdecocina.com/it/pollo-agrodolce/","language":"it","title":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni","excerpt":"Pollo, ananas fresco e peperoni con salsa agrodolce dosata. Quattro porzioni proposte, controllo con termometro e valori nutrizionali stimati.","summary":"Versione originale in padella del pollo agrodolce con ananas fresco e peperoni, senza frittura profonda né pastella spessa. Le 4 porzioni e i 51 minuti proposti devono ancora essere confermati da una prova in cucina.","category":"Secondi piatti","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Media","course":"Piatto principale","cuisine":"Ispirazione sino-americana","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"petto di pollo crudo senza pelle, ossa o soluzione aggiunta","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"amido di mais per il pollo","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Pollo"},{"name":"olio di colza per le due porzioni di pollo e le verdure","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Padella"},{"name":"ananas fresco pelato senza torsolo duro","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Verdure e frutta"},{"name":"peperone rosso senza semi e picciolo","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Verdure e frutta"},{"name":"peperone verde senza semi e picciolo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Verdure e frutta"},{"name":"cipolla sbucciata","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Verdure e frutta"},{"name":"ketchup di pomodoro normale","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"aceto bianco alimentare con acidità 5%","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"zucchero bianco semolato","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"salsa shoyu normale di soia e frumento","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"acqua potabile per salsa e sospensione","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Salsa"},{"name":"amido di mais per addensare la salsa","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Salsa"}],"steps":[{"title":"Organizzare e separare crudo e cotto","content":"Preparare una padella ampia dal fondo spesso, termometro alimentare, bilancia, ciotole, due taglieri e utensili separati per pollo crudo e cotto. Pesare 600 g di petto crudo senza pelle, ossa o soluzione aggiunta, tenere a 4°C o meno e non lavare. Se congelato, scongelare in frigorifero e aggiungere il tempo reale. Lavare le mani con sapone per almeno 20 secondi; sciacquare frutta e verdura con acqua potabile senza sapone o candeggina. I pesi sono netti commestibili. Si usa una pellicola sottile d’amido, non pastella da frittura.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Organizzare e separare crudo e cotto"},{"title":"Tagliare ananas e verdure","content":"Con tagliere e coltello puliti preparare 200 g di ananas fresco pelato senza torsolo duro, 150 g di peperone rosso, 100 g di verde e 120 g di cipolla sbucciata. Eliminare semi e piccioli e tagliare in pezzi di circa 2 cm. Tenere lontano da pollo crudo e utensili contaminati. Bucce, semi, scarti e acqua di lavaggio non rientrano nei pesi nutrizionali. Ananas sciroppato, succo, verdure extra o decorazioni cambiano la formula e richiedono un nuovo calcolo.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Tagliare ananas e verdure"},{"title":"Tagliare il pollo e rivestirlo d’amido","content":"Sul tagliere riservato alla carne cruda tagliare i 600 g di pollo in cubetti di circa 2 cm. Asciugare se necessario con carta monouso, senza lavare. Incorporare tutti i 20 g d’amido per il pollo formando una pellicola sottile. Non aggiungere uovo, farina, sale o marinata. Dividere in due porzioni da 300 g e refrigerare fino alla cottura. Pulire e disinfettare tagliere, coltello e superfici secondo il materiale; cambiare o pulire gli utensili prima di toccare il cotto.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Tagliare il pollo e rivestirlo d’amido"},{"title":"Mescolare separatamente salsa e sospensione","content":"In una ciotola pulita mescolare 80 g di ketchup, 40 g di aceto bianco alimentare al 5%, 30 g di zucchero, 20 g di shoyu normale con frumento e 120 ml d’acqua. Pesare aceto e soia in grammi senza attribuire gli stessi millilitri. In un’altra ciotola sciogliere i restanti 10 g d’amido in 30 ml d’acqua fredda, senza grumi. Totali: 150 ml d’acqua e 30 g d’amido. Utilizzare tutta la salsa e tutta la sospensione. Una soia a basso sodio richiede ricalcolo; controllare ingredienti e allergeni sulle etichette.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Mescolare separatamente salsa e sospensione"},{"title":"Cuocere il pollo in due riprese","content":"Preriscaldare la padella per circa 2 minuti a fuoco medio-alto senza farla fumare; questo tempo è incluso. Aggiungere 10 g d’olio e 300 g di pollo in un solo strato. Cuocere circa 7 minuti girando, fino ad almeno 74°C al centro dei cubetti più spessi con termometro pulito. Trasferire su un piatto pulito usando utensili del cotto. Ripetere con altri 10 g d’olio e i 300 g restanti per circa 7 minuti, controllando di nuovo 74°C. I 14 minuti sono proposti: prolungare se serve e registrare. La doratura non dimostra sicurezza. Conservare olio, succhi cotti e amido aderente per la salsa; non nascondere eventuali bruciature come formula invariata.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Cuocere il pollo in due riprese"},{"title":"Saltare verdure e ananas","content":"Versare gli ultimi 10 g d’olio nella stessa padella. Aggiungere cipolla, peperoni e ananas preparati e saltare circa 5 minuti a fuoco medio-alto con un utensile pulito. Cercare bordi appena dorati e pezzi riconoscibili, non una purea. Non aggiungere olio o scartare succhi: la salsa raccoglierà il fondo. Tutti i 30 g d’olio sono conteggiati, senza assorbimenti o perdite inventate. Tenere il pollo cotto sul piatto pulito, lontano da ciotole e utensili del crudo.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Saltare verdure e ananas"},{"title":"Cuocere e addensare la salsa","content":"Rimescolare la sospensione per sollevare l’amido depositato. Versare tutta la salsa sulle verdure e sull’ananas e sciogliere il fondo. Al leggero bollore aggiungere gradualmente tutta la sospensione mescolando e cuocere circa 3 minuti a fuoco medio. La salsa deve essere lucida e velare la spatola, senza sapore d’amido crudo o grumi secchi. Non ridurre a caramello denso né aggiungere zucchero, acqua o addensante senza registrare la modifica. Per l’evaporazione, l’acqua iniziale non rappresenta una resa finale misurata.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Cuocere e addensare la salsa"},{"title":"Riunire il pollo e controllare il risultato","content":"Rimettere tutto il pollo cotto e i succhi del suo piatto pulito in padella. Amalgamare con salsa, ananas e verdure per circa 2 minuti a fuoco medio. Controllare almeno 74°C nei cubetti più spessi con termometro pulito e prolungare se necessario. Non introdurre succhi o utensili del pollo crudo. Mantenere i pezzi riconoscibili; sesamo, cipollotto, coriandolo, riso e contorni non rientrano nei valori. La pellicola sottile non promette la croccantezza della doppia frittura.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Riunire il pollo e controllare il risultato"},{"title":"Servire e conservare in sicurezza","content":"Dividere tutto il pollo, le verdure, l’ananas e la salsa in 4 porzioni simili, senza dichiarare un peso servito misurato. Proposta: 25 minuti preparazione, 24 cottura e 2 preriscaldamento, totale 51; pollo 14, verdure 5, salsa 3, finitura 2. Nessuna marinata o attesa obbligatoria. Aggiungere ritardi reali e scongelamento; servire subito e calcolare il riso separatamente. Refrigerare in contenitori bassi entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora oltre 32°C, altrimenti scartare. Tenere a 4°C o meno, consumare entro 3 giorni proposti non testati e riscaldare a 74°C. Lo shoyu contiene soia e frumento e la salsa zuccheri aggiunti.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Pollo agrodolce in padella con ananas e peperoni: Servire e conservare in sicurezza"}],"notes":"Usare petto crudo senza pelle, ossa o soluzione aggiunta: la voce USDA non descrive pollo in salamoia. Separare crudo e cotto, non lavare il pollo e verificare 74°C con un termometro pulito. Scongelare in frigorifero e aggiungere il tempo effettivo. Dividere 30 g di amido in 20 g per pollo e 10 g per salsa; 150 ml d’acqua in 120 ml per salsa e 30 ml per sospensione. Usare tutti i 30 g d’olio in tre aggiunte da 10 g e servire tutti i succhi cotti, il fondo e la salsa; nessun assorbimento o scarto d’olio è inventato. Lo shoyu normale contiene soia e frumento: la ricetta non è senza glutine. Ketchup e zucchero apportano zuccheri aggiunti; l’ananas fresco non equivale a quello sciroppato. Registrare modifiche e guarnizioni con quantità e ricalcolare. Non aggiungere uova, farina, salsa d’ostriche, aglio, zenzero, sesamo o decorazioni. Quattro porzioni e 51 minuti non sono valori collaudati. Refrigerare in contenitori bassi a 4°C o meno entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora sopra 32°C; oltre questi limiti scartare. Consumare entro 3 giorni come proposta prudente, non durata testata, e riscaldare a 74°C. Riso e contorni si calcolano separatamente.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"petto crudo senza soluzione aggiunta","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g totali d’amido interamente incorporati","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g totali d’olio di colza senza perdita ipotizzata","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ananas fresco pulito","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peperone rosso pulito","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"peperone verde pulito","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cipolla sbucciata","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ketchup normale","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"aceto bianco distillato alimentare","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"zucchero bianco","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"shoyu normale di soia e frumento","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Un quarto di pollo, verdure, ananas e tutta la salsa; 4 porzioni proposte","method":"Undici voci USDA verificate: moltiplicare i valori per 100 g per i grammi commestibili incorporati, sommare e dividere per 4. Petto crudo FDC 171077 senza soluzione aggiunta, vegetali crudi netti, tutti i 30 g d’amido e 30 g d’olio inclusi succhi cotti e salsa. I 150 ml d’acqua non aggiungono energia; evaporazione non significa perdita di nutrienti.","note":"Stima da ingredienti, non analisi o prova in cucina. Nessun assorbimento o perdita d’olio inventato. Ananas fresco e shoyu normale con frumento; pesi finali e 4 porzioni non confermati. Riso, sesamo, cipollotto e contorni esclusi. Tutti gli 8 campi sono presenti nelle 11 voci; dati mancanti non sostituiti con zero."},"keywords":["pollo agrodolce","ananas","pollo in padella","peperoni"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Pollo agrodolce con ananas: ricetta in padella","description":"Pollo, ananas fresco e peperoni con salsa agrodolce dosata. Quattro porzioni proposte, controllo con termometro e valori nutrizionali stimati.","image_alt":"Cubetti di pollo in padella con ananas, peperoni rossi e verdi e cipolla in salsa agrodolce lucida","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Sarà croccante come il pollo fritto due volte?","a":"Non si promette quella consistenza. Pellicola sottile d’amido e olio misurato in padella non equivalgono a pastella e bagno di frittura. Cuocere in due riprese, servire dopo la salsa e controllare sempre 74°C oltre alla doratura."},{"q":"Posso usare ananas sciroppato o soia a basso sodio?","a":"Come variante registrata con quantità e nutrizione aggiornate. La formula usa ananas fresco netto e shoyu normale con frumento. Le sostituzioni non rendono automaticamente il piatto senza glutine o senza zucchero."},{"q":"Come divido l’amido e conservo gli avanzi?","a":"20 g col pollo e 10 g in 30 ml d’acqua fredda per addensare, più 120 ml d’acqua nella salsa. Refrigerare in contenitori bassi a 4°C o meno nei limiti indicati, consumare entro 3 giorni proposti e riscaldare a 74°C. I contorni sono esclusi."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Versione originale in padella del pollo agrodolce con ananas fresco e peperoni, senza frittura profonda né pastella spessa. Le 4 porzioni e i 51 minuti proposti devono ancora essere confermati da una prova in cucina.</p><p>Usare petto crudo senza pelle, ossa o soluzione aggiunta: la voce USDA non descrive pollo in salamoia. Separare crudo e cotto, non lavare il pollo e verificare 74°C con un termometro pulito. Scongelare in frigorifero e aggiungere il tempo effettivo. Dividere 30 g di amido in 20 g per pollo e 10 g per salsa; 150 ml d’acqua in 120 ml per salsa e 30 ml per sospensione. Usare tutti i 30 g d’olio in tre aggiunte da 10 g e servire tutti i succhi cotti, il fondo e la salsa; nessun assorbimento o scarto d’olio è inventato. Lo shoyu normale contiene soia e frumento: la ricetta non è senza glutine. Ketchup e zucchero apportano zuccheri aggiunti; l’ananas fresco non equivale a quello sciroppato. Registrare modifiche e guarnizioni con quantità e ricalcolare. Non aggiungere uova, farina, salsa d’ostriche, aglio, zenzero, sesamo o decorazioni. Quattro porzioni e 51 minuti non sono valori collaudati. Refrigerare in contenitori bassi a 4°C o meno entro 2 ore, oppure 1 ora sopra 32°C; oltre questi limiti scartare. Consumare entro 3 giorni come proposta prudente, non durata testata, e riscaldare a 74°C. Riso e contorni si calcolano separatamente.</p>"},{"id":"5bd8457c-2375-579b-8e89-d3b9f992e5e8","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"鶏肉の甘酢あん","public_path":"/ja/鶏肉の甘酢あん","source_url":null,"language":"ja","title":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め","excerpt":"鶏むね肉、フレッシュパイナップル、パプリカを計量した甘酢ソースで仕上げます。4人分の提案で、温度計による確認と推定栄養値付き。","summary":"揚げ油や厚い衣を使わず、フライパンで作るオリジナルの鶏肉の甘酢炒めです。フレッシュパイナップルとパプリカを合わせます。4人分、51分は提案値であり、実際の調理試験で確認した時間や出来高ではありません。","category":"主菜","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"中程度","course":"主菜","cuisine":"中国系アメリカ料理に着想","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"生の鶏むね肉、皮・骨・添加液なし","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"鶏肉"},{"name":"鶏肉用のコーンスターチ","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"鶏肉"},{"name":"鶏肉2回分と野菜用のキャノーラ油","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"フライパン用"},{"name":"生のパイナップル、皮と硬い芯を除く","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"野菜と果物"},{"name":"赤パプリカ、種とへたを除く","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"野菜と果物"},{"name":"緑パプリカ、種とへたを除く","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"野菜と果物"},{"name":"皮をむいた玉ねぎ","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"野菜と果物"},{"name":"通常のトマトケチャップ","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"酸度5%の食用ホワイトビネガー","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"白いグラニュー糖","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"大豆と小麦を含む通常の醤油","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"ソース"},{"name":"ソースと懸濁液用の飲用水","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"ソース"},{"name":"ソースをとろみ付けするコーンスターチ","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"ソース"}],"steps":[{"title":"道具を準備し、生と加熱済みを分ける","content":"厚底の大きなフライパン、食品用温度計、はかり、ボウル、まな板2枚、生肉用と加熱済み用の器具を用意します。皮、骨、添加液のない生の鶏むね肉600 gを量り、4°C以下で保管し、水洗いしません。冷凍の場合は冷蔵庫で解凍して実際の時間を別に加えます。手は石けんで20秒以上洗い、野菜と果物は切る前に飲用水で洗います。石けんや漂白剤は使いません。材料は可食部の正味重量です。厚い揚げ衣ではなく薄いでんぷんの膜で調理します。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 道具を準備し、生と加熱済みを分ける"},{"title":"パイナップルと野菜を切る","content":"清潔な野菜用まな板と包丁で、皮と硬い芯を除いた生のパイナップル200 g、赤パプリカ150 g、緑パプリカ100 g、皮をむいた玉ねぎ120 gを準備します。パプリカの種とへたを取り、すべて約2 cmに切ります。生肉とその器具から離して保管します。皮、種、芯、切りくず、洗浄水は栄養計算の重量に含めません。シロップ漬けやその液、追加の野菜や飾りを使う場合は別の配合として再計算します。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: パイナップルと野菜を切る"},{"title":"鶏肉を切って薄くでんぷんをまぶす","content":"生肉専用のまな板で600 gの鶏むね肉を約2 cm角に切ります。必要なら使い捨てペーパーで表面を拭きますが、水洗いはしません。鶏肉用コーンスターチ20 gを全量混ぜ、薄い膜にします。卵、小麦粉、塩、漬けだれは加えません。300 gずつ2回分に分け、調理まで冷蔵します。まな板、包丁、作業面は材質に適した方法で洗浄・消毒し、加熱済みを扱う前に器具を交換するか清潔にします。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 鶏肉を切って薄くでんぷんをまぶす"},{"title":"ソースとでんぷん液を別々に作る","content":"清潔なボウルでケチャップ80 g、酸度5%の食用ホワイトビネガー40 g、砂糖30 g、通常の小麦入り醤油20 g、水120 mlを混ぜます。酢と醤油はgで量り、同じ数値のmlとみなしません。別のボウルで残りのコーンスターチ10 gと冷水30 mlをだまなく混ぜます。水は計150 ml、でんぷんは計30 gです。両方を全量使います。減塩醤油は栄養再計算が必要です。大豆、小麦やその他のアレルゲン表示を確認してください。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: ソースとでんぷん液を別々に作る"},{"title":"鶏肉を2回に分けて加熱する","content":"フライパンを中強火で約2分予熱し、煙を出さないようにします。この時間も合計に含まれます。油10 gを入れ、鶏肉300 gを重ならないように並べます。返しながら約7分加熱し、最も厚い角切りの中心が清潔な温度計で74°C以上になるまで加熱します。加熱済み用の器具で清潔な皿に移します。油10 gと残り300 gで約7分繰り返し、再び74°Cを確認します。計14分は提案で、足りなければ延長して記録します。焼き色だけでは安全を判断できません。油、加熱済みの肉汁、付着したでんぷんはソースに使い、焦げた場合を同じ配合として扱いません。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 鶏肉を2回に分けて加熱する"},{"title":"野菜とパイナップルを炒める","content":"同じフライパンに最後の油10 gを加え、準備した玉ねぎ、赤と緑のパプリカ、パイナップルを入れます。清潔な器具で混ぜながら中強火で約5分炒めます。縁が軽く色づき、形が残る状態にし、ペーストにしません。油を足したり汁を捨てたりせず、次のソースで底の旨味を回収します。油30 gは全量を計算し、吸収や損失を仮定しません。加熱済みの鶏肉は清潔な皿で、生肉用の器具や容器と分けておきます。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 野菜とパイナップルを炒める"},{"title":"ソースを加熱してとろみを付ける","content":"沈んだでんぷんを浮かせるように懸濁液を再び混ぜます。準備したソース全量を野菜とパイナップルに注ぎ、フライパンの底を混ぜます。穏やかに沸いたら、混ぜながらでんぷん液を全量少しずつ加え、中火で約3分加熱します。艶が出てへらを覆い、生のでんぷんの味や乾いただまが残らない状態を目指します。濃いカラメルまで煮詰めたり、砂糖、水、増粘剤を無記録で加えたりしません。水は蒸発するため、初期の水量を完成ソースの実測重量とはしません。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: ソースを加熱してとろみを付ける"},{"title":"鶏肉を戻し、仕上がりを確認する","content":"加熱済みの鶏肉と清潔な皿の肉汁を全量戻します。中火で約2分、ソース、パイナップル、野菜と混ぜます。厚い肉の中心が清潔な温度計で74°C以上か確認し、必要なら延長します。生肉の汁やその器具は戻しません。具の形を残し、ごま、ねぎ、コリアンダー、ご飯などをこの栄養値に含めて追加しないでください。薄いでんぷん膜の炒め物であり、二度揚げのような歯触りは保証しません。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 鶏肉を戻し、仕上がりを確認する"},{"title":"盛り付け、安全に保存する","content":"鶏肉、野菜、パイナップル、ソースの全量をほぼ等しい4人分に分けます。盛り付け重量の実測値は示しません。準備25分、加熱24分、予熱2分、計51分が提案です。加熱の内訳は肉14分、野菜5分、ソース3分、仕上げ2分で、漬け込みや必須の休ませ時間はありません。実際の遅れと解凍時間を記録し、すぐに提供してご飯などは別計算にします。残りは浅い容器で2時間以内、周囲が32°Cを超える場合は1時間以内に冷蔵し、超えたものは廃棄します。4°C以下で保存し、未試験の保守的な提案として3日以内に消費し、74°Cまで再加熱します。大豆、小麦、添加糖を含みます。","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"鶏むね肉とパイナップルの甘酢炒め: 盛り付け、安全に保存する"}],"notes":"皮、骨、添加液のない生の鶏むね肉を使います。USDAの項目は塩水処理した肉ではありません。生肉と加熱済みの食品を分け、鶏肉を水洗いせず、清潔な食品用温度計で74°Cを確認します。冷凍の場合は冷蔵庫で安全に解凍し、その時間を別に加えます。コーンスターチ計30 gは肉に20 g、ソースに10 g、水150 mlはソースに120 ml、懸濁液に30 mlを使います。油計30 gは10 gずつ3回に分け、加熱済みの肉汁、フライパンの旨味、ソースを全量使います。油の吸収や廃棄量を推測して差し引きません。通常の醤油には大豆と小麦が含まれ、グルテンフリーではありません。ケチャップと砂糖は添加糖を含み、シロップ漬けパイナップルは生のものと同じ栄養計算になりません。変更や付け合わせは量を記録して再計算してください。卵、小麦粉、オイスターソース、にんにく、しょうが、ごま、飾りはこの配合に加えません。4人分と51分は未試験の提案です。残りは浅い容器で、室温に出してから2時間以内、周囲が32°Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4°C以下で冷蔵し、超えたものは廃棄します。3日以内の消費は保守的な提案で、試験済みの保存期限ではありません。再加熱は74°Cまで行い、ご飯などは別計算です。","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"添加液なしの生鶏むね肉","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"全量を混ぜ込むコーンスターチ計30 g","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"損失を仮定しないキャノーラ油計30 g","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"下処理した生パイナップル","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"下処理した赤パプリカ","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"下処理した緑パプリカ","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"皮をむいた玉ねぎ","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"通常のケチャップ","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"食用蒸留ホワイトビネガー","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"白砂糖","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"大豆と小麦入りの通常醤油","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"鶏肉、野菜、パイナップル、ソース全量の4分の1；4人分の提案","method":"確認済みのUSDA11項目を用い、100 g当たりの値に使用した可食部重量を掛け、合計を4で割ります。添加液のない生むね肉FDC 171077、正味の生野菜と果物、でんぷん30 g、油30 gを全量とし、加熱済みの汁とソースも含めます。水150 mlにエネルギーはなく、蒸発を栄養損失とみなしません。","note":"材料に基づく推定で、分析や調理試験ではありません。油の吸収や損失は作りません。生パイナップルと小麦入り通常醤油を使用し、完成重量と4人分は未確認です。ご飯、ごま、ねぎ、付け合わせは計算外。11項目すべてに8栄養値があり、欠測をゼロで埋めません。"},"keywords":["鶏肉の甘酢あん","パイナップル","鶏むね肉","パプリカ"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"鶏肉の甘酢あん：パイナップルとパプリカのフライパン調理","description":"鶏むね肉、フレッシュパイナップル、パプリカを計量した甘酢ソースで仕上げます。4人分の提案で、温度計による確認と推定栄養値付き。","image_alt":"鶏むね肉の角切り、パイナップル、赤と緑のパプリカ、玉ねぎを艶のある甘酢ソースで仕上げた料理","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"二度揚げのようにカリカリになりますか？","a":"その食感は保証しません。薄いでんぷん膜と計量した油での炒め調理は、厚い衣と揚げ油とは異なります。2回に分けて加熱し、ソースを絡めたら提供します。焼き色にかかわらず74°Cを温度計で確認してください。"},{"q":"シロップ漬けパイナップルや減塩醤油を使えますか？","a":"使用量と栄養値を見直して記録する別配合として使えます。この配合は生の正味パイナップルと小麦入り通常醤油を使用します。置き換えだけでグルテンフリーや無糖になるわけではありません。"},{"q":"でんぷんの分け方と残りの保存は？","a":"肉に20 g、増粘用に10 gと冷水30 mlを使い、ソースには水120 mlを入れます。浅い容器で指定の時間内に4°C以下で冷蔵し、提案として3日以内に消費、74°Cまで再加熱します。付け合わせは計算外です。"}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>揚げ油や厚い衣を使わず、フライパンで作るオリジナルの鶏肉の甘酢炒めです。フレッシュパイナップルとパプリカを合わせます。4人分、51分は提案値であり、実際の調理試験で確認した時間や出来高ではありません。</p><p>皮、骨、添加液のない生の鶏むね肉を使います。USDAの項目は塩水処理した肉ではありません。生肉と加熱済みの食品を分け、鶏肉を水洗いせず、清潔な食品用温度計で74°Cを確認します。冷凍の場合は冷蔵庫で安全に解凍し、その時間を別に加えます。コーンスターチ計30 gは肉に20 g、ソースに10 g、水150 mlはソースに120 ml、懸濁液に30 mlを使います。油計30 gは10 gずつ3回に分け、加熱済みの肉汁、フライパンの旨味、ソースを全量使います。油の吸収や廃棄量を推測して差し引きません。通常の醤油には大豆と小麦が含まれ、グルテンフリーではありません。ケチャップと砂糖は添加糖を含み、シロップ漬けパイナップルは生のものと同じ栄養計算になりません。変更や付け合わせは量を記録して再計算してください。卵、小麦粉、オイスターソース、にんにく、しょうが、ごま、飾りはこの配合に加えません。4人分と51分は未試験の提案です。残りは浅い容器で、室温に出してから2時間以内、周囲が32°Cを超える場合は1時間以内に4°C以下で冷蔵し、超えたものは廃棄します。3日以内の消費は保守的な提案で、試験済みの保存期限ではありません。再加熱は74°Cまで行い、ご飯などは別計算です。</p>"},{"id":"723d5535-70ee-5b49-8e86-7cad53ba06db","recipe_group_id":"aad582c9-6559-4226-a297-8294c664d4c5","slug":"frango-agridoce","public_path":"/pt/frango-agridoce","source_url":null,"language":"pt","title":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões","excerpt":"Frango, abacaxi fresco e pimentões com molho agridoce medido. Quatro porções propostas, controle com termômetro e informação nutricional estimada.","summary":"Versão original de frango agridoce na frigideira, com abacaxi fresco e pimentões, sem fritura por imersão nem massa grossa. As 4 porções e os 51 minutos propostos ainda não foram confirmados em teste de cozinha.","category":"Pratos principais","category_slug":"platos-principales","difficulty":"Média","course":"Prato principal","cuisine":"Inspiração sino-americana","prep_time_minutes":25,"cook_time_minutes":24,"total_time_minutes":51,"servings":4,"ingredients":[{"name":"peito de frango cru sem pele, ossos ou solução adicionada","amount":"600","unit":"g","group":"Frango"},{"name":"amido de milho para o frango","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Frango"},{"name":"óleo de canola para as duas levas de frango e os legumes","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Frigideira"},{"name":"abacaxi fresco descascado sem miolo duro","amount":"200","unit":"g","group":"Legumes e fruta"},{"name":"pimentão vermelho sem sementes nem talo","amount":"150","unit":"g","group":"Legumes e fruta"},{"name":"pimentão verde sem sementes nem talo","amount":"100","unit":"g","group":"Legumes e fruta"},{"name":"cebola descascada","amount":"120","unit":"g","group":"Legumes e fruta"},{"name":"ketchup de tomate comum","amount":"80","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"vinagre branco alimentício com acidez 5%","amount":"40","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"açúcar branco granulado","amount":"30","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"shoyu comum de soja e trigo","amount":"20","unit":"g","group":"Molho"},{"name":"água potável para o molho e a suspensão","amount":"150","unit":"ml","group":"Molho"},{"name":"amido de milho para engrossar o molho","amount":"10","unit":"g","group":"Molho"}],"steps":[{"title":"Organize e separe alimentos crus e cozidos","content":"Separe frigideira grande de fundo grosso, termômetro culinário, balança, tigelas, duas tábuas e utensílios distintos para frango cru e cozido. Pese 600 g de peito cru sem pele, ossos ou solução adicionada, mantenha a 4°C ou menos e não lave. Se congelado, descongele com segurança na geladeira e acrescente o tempo real. Lave as mãos com sabão por pelo menos 20 segundos; lave frutas e legumes com água potável antes de cortar, sem sabão ou água sanitária. Os pesos são líquidos comestíveis. É uma versão na frigideira com película fina de amido, não massa para fritura por imersão.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-01.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Organize e separe alimentos crus e cozidos"},{"title":"Corte o abacaxi e os legumes","content":"Em tábua limpa para vegetais, prepare 200 g de abacaxi fresco sem casca e miolo duro, 150 g de pimentão vermelho, 100 g de verde e 120 g de cebola descascada. Retire sementes e talos e corte em pedaços de cerca de 2 cm. Afaste de frango cru e seus utensílios. Cascas, sementes, aparas e água de lavagem não entram nos pesos nutricionais. Abacaxi em calda, seu líquido, legumes extras e enfeites mudam a fórmula e exigem recálculo.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-02.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Corte o abacaxi e os legumes"},{"title":"Corte o frango e cubra com uma película de amido","content":"Na tábua exclusiva para carne crua, corte os 600 g de peito em cubos de aproximadamente 2 cm. Se necessário, seque com papel descartável, sem lavar. Misture todos os 20 g de amido destinados ao frango, formando uma camada fina. Não acrescente ovo, farinha, sal ou marinada. Divida em duas levas de 300 g e mantenha refrigerado até cozinhar. Limpe e desinfete tábua, faca e superfícies conforme o material; troque ou higienize utensílios antes de tocar o cozido.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-03.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Corte o frango e cubra com uma película de amido"},{"title":"Prepare o molho e a suspensão separadamente","content":"Em tigela limpa, misture 80 g de ketchup, 40 g de vinagre branco alimentício a 5%, 30 g de açúcar, 20 g de shoyu comum com trigo e 120 ml de água. Pese vinagre e shoyu em gramas, sem assumir volume igual em mililitros. Em outra tigela, dissolva os 10 g restantes de amido em 30 ml de água fria sem grumos. Totais: 150 ml de água e 30 g de amido. Incorpore todo o molho e a suspensão. Shoyu com sódio reduzido exige novo cálculo; confira rótulos e alergênicos.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-04.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Prepare o molho e a suspensão separadamente"},{"title":"Cozinhe o frango em duas levas","content":"Preaqueça a frigideira por cerca de 2 minutos em fogo médio-alto, sem deixar fumegar; esse tempo está incluído. Adicione 10 g de óleo e uma leva de 300 g de frango em camada única. Cozinhe por cerca de 7 minutos, virando, até os cubos mais grossos atingirem pelo menos 74°C no centro com termômetro limpo. Transfira para prato limpo com utensílios do cozido. Repita com outros 10 g de óleo e os 300 g restantes por aproximadamente 7 minutos e confira novamente 74°C. São 14 minutos propostos; prolongue se preciso e registre. Dourar não comprova segurança. Guarde óleo, sucos cozidos e amido aderido para o molho; não esconda queimaduras como se a fórmula fosse igual.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-05.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Cozinhe o frango em duas levas"},{"title":"Salteie legumes e abacaxi","content":"Adicione os últimos 10 g de óleo à mesma frigideira, seguidos de cebola, pimentões e abacaxi preparados. Salteie por cerca de 5 minutos em fogo médio-alto com utensílio limpo. Busque bordas levemente douradas e pedaços reconhecíveis, sem virar purê. Não adicione óleo nem descarte líquidos; o molho soltará o fundo. Todos os 30 g de óleo entram na estimativa, sem absorção ou perda inventada. Mantenha o frango cozido no prato limpo, afastado dos recipientes e utensílios do cru.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-06.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Salteie legumes e abacaxi"},{"title":"Cozinhe e engrosse o molho","content":"Mexa novamente a suspensão para levantar o amido depositado. Despeje todo o molho sobre legumes e abacaxi e solte o fundo. Ao começar a ferver suavemente, adicione aos poucos toda a suspensão, mexendo, e cozinhe por cerca de 3 minutos em fogo médio. O molho deve ficar brilhante e cobrir a espátula, sem gosto de amido cru ou grumos secos. Não reduza a caramelo grosso nem adicione açúcar, água ou espessante sem registrar. Pela evaporação, a água inicial não corresponde a um rendimento final medido do molho.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-07.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Cozinhe e engrosse o molho"},{"title":"Junte o frango e confira o acabamento","content":"Volte todo o frango cozido e os sucos do prato limpo à frigideira. Misture com molho, abacaxi e legumes por cerca de 2 minutos em fogo médio. Confira pelo menos 74°C nos cubos mais grossos com termômetro limpo e prolongue se necessário. Não junte sucos ou utensílios do frango cru. Mantenha os pedaços reconhecíveis; gergelim, cebolinha, coentro, arroz e guarnições não fazem parte destes valores. A película fina de amido não promete crocância de dupla fritura.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/paso-08.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Junte o frango e confira o acabamento"},{"title":"Sirva e conserve com segurança","content":"Divida todo o frango, os legumes, o abacaxi e o molho em 4 porções semelhantes; não se afirma peso servido medido. Proposta: 25 minutos de preparo, 24 de cozimento e 2 de preaquecimento, total 51; frango 14, legumes 5, molho 3, acabamento 2. Sem marinada ou descanso obrigatório. Registre atrasos reais e descongelamento extra; sirva logo e calcule arroz à parte. Refrigere sobras em recipientes rasos antes de 2 horas, ou 1 hora acima de 32°C, e descarte se ultrapassar. Mantenha a 4°C ou menos, consuma em até 3 dias propostos não testados e reaqueça a 74°C. Shoyu contém soja e trigo; o molho tem açúcares adicionados.","image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","image_alt":"Frango agridoce na frigideira com abacaxi e pimentões: Sirva e conserve com segurança"}],"notes":"Use peito cru sem pele, ossos ou solução adicionada; a ficha USDA não representa frango em salmoura. Separe cru e cozido, não lave o frango e confira 74°C com termômetro limpo. Descongele na geladeira e some o tempo real. Divida 30 g de amido em 20 g para frango e 10 g para molho; 150 ml de água em 120 ml no molho e 30 ml na suspensão. Use os 30 g de óleo em três adições de 10 g, incluindo todos os sucos do frango cozido, o fundo e o molho. Não se inventa absorção ou descarte de óleo. Shoyu comum contém soja e trigo; a receita não é sem glúten. Ketchup e açúcar fornecem açúcares adicionados; abacaxi fresco não equivale ao em calda. Alterações e guarnições exigem quantidades registradas e novo cálculo. Não acrescente ovos, farinha, molho de ostras, alho, gengibre, gergelim ou enfeites à fórmula. Quatro porções e 51 minutos são propostas, não resultados testados. Refrigere em recipientes rasos a 4°C ou menos antes de 2 horas fora do frio, ou 1 hora acima de 32°C; descarte se ultrapassar. Consuma em até 3 dias como proposta conservadora, não validade ensaiada, e reaqueça a 74°C. Arroz e acompanhamentos são calculados à parte.","nutrition":{"calories":380.3,"protein_g":35.6,"carbs_g":32.9,"fat_g":11.7,"saturated_fat_g":1.5,"sodium_mg":528.3,"fiber_g":2.6,"sugar_g":20.1,"estimated":true,"source":"USDA FoodData Central — SR Legacy (abril de 2018)","source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/","inputs":[{"ingredient":"peito cru sem solução adicionada","edible_grams":600,"fdc_id":171077,"fdc_description":"Chicken, broiler or fryers, breast, skinless, boneless, meat only, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":2.62,"calories":120,"saturated_fat_g":0.563,"sodium_mg":45.0,"protein_g":22.5,"sugar_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171077/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g totais de amido integralmente incorporados","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169698,"fdc_description":"Cornstarch","per_100g":{"sugar_g":0.0,"fat_g":0.05,"carbs_g":91.3,"calories":381,"protein_g":0.26,"fiber_g":0.9,"sodium_mg":9.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.009},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169698/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"30 g totais de óleo de canola sem perda suposta","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":172336,"fdc_description":"Oil, canola","per_100g":{"fat_g":100,"saturated_fat_g":7.36,"protein_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.0,"calories":884,"fiber_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":0.0,"sugar_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172336/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"abacaxi fresco limpo","edible_grams":200,"fdc_id":169124,"fdc_description":"Pineapple, raw, all varieties","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.54,"sodium_mg":1.0,"sugar_g":9.85,"fat_g":0.12,"fiber_g":1.4,"saturated_fat_g":0.009,"carbs_g":13.1,"calories":50.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169124/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimentão vermelho limpo","edible_grams":150,"fdc_id":170108,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, red, raw","per_100g":{"fiber_g":2.1,"calories":26.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.059,"sodium_mg":4.0,"sugar_g":4.2,"carbs_g":6.03,"protein_g":0.99,"fat_g":0.3},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170108/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"pimentão verde limpo","edible_grams":100,"fdc_id":170427,"fdc_description":"Peppers, sweet, green, raw","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.17,"protein_g":0.86,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":3.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.058,"carbs_g":4.64,"calories":20.0,"sugar_g":2.4},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170427/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"cebola descascada","edible_grams":120,"fdc_id":170000,"fdc_description":"Onions, raw","per_100g":{"sugar_g":4.24,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":9.34,"calories":40.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.042,"protein_g":1.1,"fiber_g":1.7,"sodium_mg":4.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170000/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"ketchup comum","edible_grams":80,"fdc_id":168556,"fdc_description":"Catsup","per_100g":{"sodium_mg":907,"protein_g":1.04,"fiber_g":0.3,"saturated_fat_g":0.014,"sugar_g":21.3,"fat_g":0.1,"carbs_g":27.4,"calories":101},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168556/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"vinagre branco destilado alimentício","edible_grams":40,"fdc_id":172237,"fdc_description":"Vinegar, distilled","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":0.04,"protein_g":0.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":2.0,"fiber_g":0.0,"carbs_g":0.04,"calories":18.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/172237/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"açúcar branco","edible_grams":30,"fdc_id":169655,"fdc_description":"Sugars, granulated","per_100g":{"protein_g":0.0,"sodium_mg":1.0,"fat_g":0.0,"calories":387,"saturated_fat_g":0.0,"sugar_g":99.8,"carbs_g":100,"fiber_g":0.0},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169655/nutrients"},{"ingredient":"shoyu comum de soja e trigo","edible_grams":20,"fdc_id":174277,"fdc_description":"Soy sauce made from soy and wheat (shoyu)","per_100g":{"fat_g":0.57,"carbs_g":4.93,"sugar_g":0.4,"protein_g":8.14,"sodium_mg":5490.0,"saturated_fat_g":0.073,"calories":53.0,"fiber_g":0.8},"source_url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174277/nutrients"}],"serving_size":"Um quarto do frango, legumes, abacaxi e todo o molho; 4 porções propostas","method":"Onze fichas USDA verificadas: multiplicar valores por 100 g pelos gramas comestíveis incorporados, somar e dividir por 4. Peito cru FDC 171077 sem solução adicionada, vegetais crus líquidos, todos os 30 g de amido e 30 g de óleo, incluindo sucos cozidos e molho. Os 150 ml de água não acrescentam energia; evaporação não é perda de nutrientes.","note":"Estimativa por ingredientes, não análise nem teste de cozinha. Nenhuma absorção ou perda de óleo inventada. Abacaxi fresco e shoyu comum com trigo; pesos finais e 4 porções não confirmados. Arroz, gergelim, cebolinha e acompanhamentos excluídos. Os 8 campos existem nas 11 fichas; dados ausentes não são preenchidos com zero."},"keywords":["frango agridoce","abacaxi","frango na frigideira","pimentões"],"image_url":"/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada.webp","gallery":[],"seo":{"title":"Frango agridoce com abacaxi: receita na frigideira","description":"Frango, abacaxi fresco e pimentões com molho agridoce medido. Quatro porções propostas, controle com termômetro e informação nutricional estimada.","image_alt":"Cubos de frango na frigideira com abacaxi, pimentões vermelhos e verdes e cebola em molho agridoce brilhante","image_variants":["/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-1x1.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-4x3.webp","/recetas/pollo-agridulce/portada-16x9.webp"],"faq":[{"q":"Fica crocante como frango frito duas vezes?","a":"Não se promete essa textura. Película fina de amido e óleo medido na frigideira não equivalem a massa e banho de fritura. Cozinhe em duas levas, sirva após juntar o molho e confira sempre 74°C, independentemente da cor."},{"q":"Posso usar abacaxi em calda ou shoyu com menos sódio?","a":"Como variação registrada com quantidades e nutrição revistas. A fórmula usa abacaxi fresco líquido e shoyu comum com trigo. Trocas não tornam automaticamente o prato sem glúten ou sem açúcar."},{"q":"Como divido o amido e guardo as sobras?","a":"Use 20 g com o frango e 10 g em 30 ml de água fria para engrossar, além de 120 ml de água no molho. Refrigere em recipientes rasos a 4°C ou menos nos limites indicados, consuma em 3 dias propostos e reaqueça a 74°C. Acompanhamentos ficam fora do cálculo."}]},"published":false,"editorial_status":"draft","content_html":"<p>Versão original de frango agridoce na frigideira, com abacaxi fresco e pimentões, sem fritura por imersão nem massa grossa. As 4 porções e os 51 minutos propostos ainda não foram confirmados em teste de cozinha.</p><p>Use peito cru sem pele, ossos ou solução adicionada; a ficha USDA não representa frango em salmoura. Separe cru e cozido, não lave o frango e confira 74°C com termômetro limpo. Descongele na geladeira e some o tempo real. Divida 30 g de amido em 20 g para frango e 10 g para molho; 150 ml de água em 120 ml no molho e 30 ml na suspensão. Use os 30 g de óleo em três adições de 10 g, incluindo todos os sucos do frango cozido, o fundo e o molho. Não se inventa absorção ou descarte de óleo. Shoyu comum contém soja e trigo; a receita não é sem glúten. Ketchup e açúcar fornecem açúcares adicionados; abacaxi fresco não equivale ao em calda. Alterações e guarnições exigem quantidades registradas e novo cálculo. Não acrescente ovos, farinha, molho de ostras, alho, gengibre, gergelim ou enfeites à fórmula. Quatro porções e 51 minutos são propostas, não resultados testados. Refrigere em recipientes rasos a 4°C ou menos antes de 2 horas fora do frio, ou 1 hora acima de 32°C; descarte se ultrapassar. Consuma em até 3 dias como proposta conservadora, não validade ensaiada, e reaqueça a 74°C. Arroz e acompanhamentos são calculados à parte.</p>"}]$records$::jsonb;
